@@ -23,6 +23,17 @@ You can stay up to date with my skills here:
 
 ## Install
 
+### Claude Code plugin
+
+```
+/plugin marketplace add siddu1004/skills-claude-antigravity
+/plugin install emil-design-skills@skills-claude-antigravity
+```
+
+On Claude Code 2.1.275 or later this is one step: `/plugin install emil-design-skills --marketplace siddu1004/skills-claude-antigravity`.
+
+### Agent Skills CLI
+
 ```bash
 npx skills@latest add emilkowalski/skills
 ```
